          "date": "2026-11-04 20:40:34.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-20434 build: include linux/fs.h in file_kattr probe",
        "message": "LU-20434 build: include linux/fs.h in file_kattr probe\n\nSince kernel v7.0 (commit 0e6b7eae1fde \"fs: add FS_XFLAG_VERITY for\nfs-verity files\"), linux/fileattr.h references struct fsxattr, the\nFS_XFLAG_* constants and struct mnt_idmap without including\nlinux/fs.h itself. The LC_HAVE_FILE_KATTR probe compiles with -Werror\nand only includes linux/fileattr.h, so it fails on every kernel that\nactually has struct file_kattr. configure then defines file_kattr as\nfileattr, a struct that no longer exists on those kernels.\n\nInclude linux/fs.h before linux/fileattr.h in the probe.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ifa122ffebb0d73f12a2fcae1c0673a266a6a6964\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
